Place the downloaded datasets here; see ../docs/DATA.md.

    data/DataSetA/   batch1.dat ... batch10.dat      (UCI Gas Sensor Array Drift)
    data/DataSetB/   batch1.csv ... batch5.csv       (produced by scripts/preprocess_datasetB.py)
    data/DataSetB-raw/  B*_G*_F*_R*.txt              (raw UCI Twin Gas Sensor Arrays)
